  "details": "Currently on quest the automatic compression when in low memory mode was noticeably redone on android to be much more strict, however the cartoony avatars i create using incredibly low memory texture grids are blurred together and turn ugly, resulting in bad coloration. Please make it to where the compression only takes effect when an avatar’s texture memory is for example above 1mb and do not compress textures with memory amounts below this.",
